armland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/montana/golden-valley-county"],["ARC or PLC in Golden Valley County","/arc-plc/montana/golden-valley-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids June to July came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 the middle ran 223% of normal in January to February but 82% in August to September. So far in 2026 the middle shows 52% of normal in April to May and 54% in May to June. Grid 31282 had its driest year in 2012 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
